  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">해수의 연직 수온 분포 실험을 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2009 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교육과정 때 샀던 장치를 사용하였고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 준비물은 아래와 같습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994BB5385D94203B20\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"준비물.jpg\"  id=\"A_994BB5385D94203B205CBC\"/>&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교과서 장치와 두 <span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가지가 다릅니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">적외선 등이 아닌 백열전등을 비추었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">온도계를 수조 둘레에 설치한 점입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수조의 중앙을 가로질러 설치하려고 해도 온도계 고정 장치가 테두리에 맞게 만들어져 이런저런 도구를 사용해 보았지만 그렇게 할 수 없었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">원래의 장치에 포함된 백열전등으로는 온도의 변화가 미약하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고정 장치에 넣은 온도계의 구부가 수조의 벽에 닿아 수온을 측정하는 목적과 맞지 않은 점이 문제였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">적외선 등을 추가로 구입하려 했으나 과학 교재상에서 고온으로 인한 문제가 발생할 소지가 있다고 하여 별도로 마련하지 않았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">문제점을 해결하려고 이렇게 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수온을 높이기 위해 장치에 포함된 전구에다 백열전등 하나씩 추가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">온도계가 수조의 벽에 닿는 문제는 스타이로폼 조각을 수조와 온도계 사이에 끼워 공간 만들기(사진으로 구분 되시지요?)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">온도계 자체의 오차가 있어 처음 온도가 일정하지 않습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생들에게 처음 온도에서 얼마나 변하였는지가 중요하다고 강조하면서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">소수 첫째 자리까지 정밀하게 측정해야만 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도 이하의 온도변화도 의미를 부여할 수 있다고 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이번 실험이 아니더라도 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1/10 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">눈금까지 측정하는 것이 맞으니까요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아직 학생들의 보고서를 다 검토하지는 않았고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">손에 잡히는 대로 두 명의 결과를 올리면 아래와 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B5E8395D94207E1A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"탐구결과1.jpg\"  id=\"A_99B5E8395D94207E1AA0E7\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EA8E3F5D94209123\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"탐구결과2.jpg\"  id=\"A_99EA8E3F5D942091237967\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이번 실험을 통해 학생들은 온도 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도가 올라간다는 의미를 제대로 파악했다고 믿습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">다음 시간에 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실험 결과를 분석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수면 부근의 온도변화가 가장 크다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선풍기로 바람을 일으키면 수면 부근의 온도가 백열전등을 비추었을 때 보다 내려간다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. A, B </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">층의 온도가 일정한 모둠이 있으면 크게 칭찬하고 실제 바다의 경우를 예로 들어 설명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하고 난 후 그래프 그리기는 우리 학교와 다른 교과서 출판사에서 제시한 값을 대입하려고 해요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 값이 그래프 그리기에 최적이어서 선택하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년 친구들</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">! </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">덥고 습한 날씨에 최선을 다하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">손 선풍기는 워낙 많이 가지고 다니는 물건이라 학교에서 준비하지 않았다고 했는데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">탁상형 대형</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(?) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선풍기까지 가지고 오는 열의를 보였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A6693E5D9420B62F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"대형 선풍기 준비.jpg\"  id=\"A_99A6693E5D9420B62F9FC4\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">두 개의 백열전등을 사용하여 실험 중입니다. <br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99220A405D9420E82E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"실험 중.jpg\"  id=\"A_99220A405D9420E82EED71\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선풍기를 여러 대 가져온 팀들도 있었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A06C395D9421752B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"초강력 바람.jpg\"  id=\"A_99A06C395D9421752B602A\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">온도를 조금이라도 높여보겠다고 손전등을 비춘 팀도 있었지만 온도 상승에 도움이 되지는 않았습니다. 외부 온도를 차단하겠다고 탐구보고서로 막은 팀은 노력이 가상하다고 칭찬해주었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9958D9335D9421F527\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"손전등은 영향 미약.jpg\"  id=\"A_9958D9335D9421F52724EF\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EFB53C5D9422072C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"외부영향 차단 중.jpg\"  id=\"A_99EFB53C5D9422072C62BC\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 실험을 해 보신 선생님들! 팁을 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">적외선 등을 사용한 결과가 궁금하고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">의미 있는 온도변화가 나왔다면 방법을 알려주세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림